[[File:Soothing (Beta 13.1).png|thumb|234x234px|Post Beta 13.1]]
Soothing was added in '''Beta 11.0''' during UnderCards' 1 Year Anniversary as [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Category:Kindness Kindness]' 2nd [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Category:Epic Epic] spell. When first released, it would set a monster to 3/3 at the cost of 3G. '''Beta 13.1''' made the monster have 1 less HP, leaving it with 3/2.
[[File:Soothing (Beta 17.0).png|thumb|234x234px|Post Beta 17.0]]
'''Beta 17.0''' swapped its rarity with that of [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Longevity Longevity], making that an Epic and this a [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Category:Rare Rare]. '''Beta 40.0''' increased its cost to 4G.
[[File:Soothing (Beta 33.0).png|thumb|236x236px|Post Beta 33.0]]

